---
// ReviewsAndSocial.astro
---

<section class="relative py-20 px-4 sm:px-6 md:px-8 bg-munches-cream text-munches-navy border-b-4 border-munches-navy">
  
  <div class="max-w-6xl mx-auto">
    
    <div class="text-center max-w-2xl mx-auto mb-16">
      <span class="bg-munches-orange text-munches-cream text-xs font-black tracking-widest uppercase px-3 py-1 rounded-full border-2 border-munches-navy shadow-pop-sm mb-3">
        REAL FEEDBACK
      </span>
      <h2 class="font-bubble text-4xl sm:text-5xl font-black text-munches-navy tracking-tight mt-2">
        Over 12,000 Edges Taken Off.
      </h2>
      <p class="font-bold text-sm sm:text-base text-munches-navy/80 mt-2">
        Here is what happens when people swap chalky gym bars for high-grade cheese sticks in flip-top boxes.
      </p>
    </div>

    <!-- Review Cards Grid -->
    <div class="grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-3 gap-6 lg:gap-8 mb-12">
      
      <!-- Review 1 -->
      <div class="bg-munches-ivory border-3 border-munches-navy rounded-3xl p-6 shadow-pop-navy flex flex-col justify-between">
        <div>
          <div class="flex items-center justify-between mb-3">
            <div class="flex text-munches-yellow text-sm">★★★★★</div>
            <span class="text-[10px] font-black uppercase text-munches-orange bg-munches-orange/10 px-2 py-0.5 rounded">VERIFIED HABIT</span>
          </div>
          <p class="text-xs sm:text-sm font-bold text-munches-navy/90 leading-relaxed mb-4">
            "My boss literally saw me standing outside by the bike racks holding a Munches stick and asked if I started smoking. I said 'No, I just need 14g of protein before this quarterly review.' Funniest purchase I've ever made, and the macros are legit insane."
          </p>
        </div>
        <div class="flex items-center gap-3 pt-3 border-t-2 border-munches-navy/10">
          <div class="w-8 h-8 rounded-full bg-munches-orange text-white font-bubble font-black flex items-center justify-center text-xs">
            D
          </div>
          <div>
            <div class="text-xs font-black text-munches-navy">Devin M.</div>
            <div class="text-[10px] font-bold text-munches-navy/60">Software Engineer • Seattle, WA</div>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>

      <!-- Review 2 (Featured) -->
      <div class="bg-munches-yellow border-4 border-munches-navy rounded-3xl p-6 shadow-pop-navy flex flex-col justify-between transform md:-translate-y-2">
        <div>
          <div class="flex items-center justify-between mb-3">
            <div class="flex text-munches-navy text-sm">★★★★★</div>
            <span class="text-[10px] font-black uppercase text-munches-navy bg-white px-2 py-0.5 rounded border border-munches-navy">TOP REVIEW</span>
          </div>
          <p class="text-xs sm:text-sm font-black text-munches-navy leading-relaxed mb-4">
            "I used to buy the 48-pack from Costco and carry loose sticks in my gym bag until they got warm and weird. The flip-top box is genius. The Pepper Jack has an actual kick to it. Stopped buying $4 protein bars entirely."
          </p>
        </div>
        <div class="flex items-center gap-3 pt-3 border-t-2 border-munches-navy/20">
          <div class="w-8 h-8 rounded-full bg-munches-navy text-munches-cream font-bubble font-black flex items-center justify-center text-xs">
            T
          </div>
          <div>
            <div class="text-xs font-black text-munches-navy">Tyler R.</div>
            <div class="text-[10px] font-black text-munches-navy/80">Crossfit Coach • Austin, TX</div>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>

      <!-- Review 3 -->
      <div class="bg-munches-ivory border-3 border-munches-navy rounded-3xl p-6 shadow-pop-navy flex flex-col justify-between">
        <div>
          <div class="flex items-center justify-between mb-3">
            <div class="flex text-munches-yellow text-sm">★★★★★</div>
            <span class="text-[10px] font-black uppercase text-munches-green bg-munches-green/10 px-2 py-0.5 rounded">CHEESE CONVERT</span>
          </div>
          <p class="text-xs sm:text-sm font-bold text-munches-navy/90 leading-relaxed mb-4">
            "The Smoked Gouda is ridiculous. It peels in these perfect thin savory ribbons. The cardboard carton feels so satisfying to flick open with your thumb during a long zoom call. 10/10 concept."
          </p>
        </div>
        <div class="flex items-center gap-3 pt-3 border-t-2 border-munches-navy/10">
          <div class="w-8 h-8 rounded-full bg-munches-green text-white font-bubble font-black flex items-center justify-center text-xs">
            S
          </div>
          <div>
            <div class="text-xs font-black text-munches-navy">Samantha K.</div>
            <div class="text-[10px] font-bold text-munches-navy/60">Product Designer • Brooklyn, NY</div>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>

    </div>

    <!-- Community Quote Banner -->
    <div class="bg-munches-sky border-3 border-munches-navy rounded-2xl p-4 sm:p-6 text-center shadow-pop-sm flex flex-col sm:flex-row items-center justify-between gap-4">
      <div class="flex items-center gap-3 text-left">
        <span class="text-3xl">📸</span>
        <div>
          <div class="font-bubble text-lg font-black text-munches-navy">Tag your break with #MunchesCheese</div>
          <div class="text-xs font-bold text-munches-navy/80">Every week we send a 10-pack carton to the most creative edge-off photo.</div>
        </div>
      </div>
      <a 
        href="#flavors"
        class="btn-tactile bg-munches-orange text-munches-cream px-5 py-2.5 rounded-xl font-black text-xs uppercase border-2 border-munches-navy shadow-sm whitespace-nowrap"
      >
        JOIN THE STASH ➔
      </a>
    </div>

  </div>
</section>
